  "behavior": [
    "Distinct read-only selected-source forest captures complete selected subtrees and bounded partial ancestors without whole-project partition or exclusion rights.",
    "Shared no-follow stream hashing and complete hardlink groups permit cross-item aliases/hardlinks only wholly inside selected union. Selected-root replacement, escape, overlapping selections, partial-ancestor aliases, incomplete groups and changed/new selected members refuse.",
    "Actual canonical coordinates and original forest/census/ledger/native identities feed local and canonical Git planning, staged projections, real provenance, control finalization and one-use source ownership handoff. Shared inputs hashed once; expanded outputs charged separately under original policy.",
    "Forest and inherited whole-tree native close reject each unknown/changed name and native node before retention or descent, preserving missing-member and final native/control checks."
  ],
